    "chunk_text": "\u00e6re \u00dea eode se m\u00e6ssepreost to Aidane \u00fe\u00e6m biscope; b\u00e6d hine \u00fe\u00e6t he for hine geb\u00e6de & for his \u00dea dyde he swa: geb\u00e6d heo fore & heo gebletsade & Gode bebead; sealde eac swylce \u00fe\u00e6m Cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to: Ic wat sona, cw\u00e6\u00f0 he, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee ge in scip astiga\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t ofer eow cyme\u00f0 micel storm Ac gemyne \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00feisne ele, \u00fee ic \u00fee nu sylle, synd in \u00fea s\u00e6; & sona inst\u00e6pe se wind gestille\u00f0 Ond eal \u00feas \u00feing, swa se biscop forecw\u00e6\u00f0, of endebyrdnesse gelumpun & gefylde w\u00e6ron. Ond sona \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee heo in scip eodon & ut leton, \u00fe\u00e6tte astigon wi\u00f0orwearde windas, & \u00fea \u00dea ongunnon \u00fea nedlingas & \u00fea scipmen \u00fea oncras upp teon, & in \u00feone s\u00e6 syndon; woldon \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00feeah \u00fee heo \u00feis dydon, noht heo on \u00feon fremedon; ac \u00fea y\u00f0a weollon & ymbsweopon & \u00dea \u00e6t nyhstan gemunde se m\u00e6ssepreost \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes word: genom his ompellan, & sumne d\u00e6l Ond sona inst\u00e6pe, swa hit forecweden w\u00e6s, gestilde se s\u00e6 from \u00fe\u00e6m wylme. Ond swa w\u00e6s geworden, \u00fe\u00e6tte se Godes wer \u00feurh witedomes gast \u00feone storm toweardne \u00deisses wundres endebyrdnesse n\u00e6nig tweonde secgend, ac se getreowesta m\u00e6ssepreost usse S\u00e6gde he, he hit gehyrde from \u00fe\u00e6m seolfan Uttan m\u00e6ssepreoste, in \u00fe\u00e6m & \u00fe",
